OL,3,GNEWSAVictims say they lost #64k to     
OL,4,A'cowboy builder'                       
OL,6,FTwo victims of a jailed "cowboy        
OL,7,Fbuilder" who defrauded their families  
OL,8,Fout of more than #64,000 say he has had
OL,9,Fa devastating impact on their lives.   
OL,11,FJamie Martin, 35, of no fixed abode,   
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to two counts of fraud  
OL,13,Fand was sentenced to three years and   
OL,14,Ftwo months in prison after a hearing at
OL,15,FLincoln Crown Court on 29 October.     
OL,17,FEmma-Jayne Kelly said she lost nearly  
OL,18,F#40,000 to the "larger-than-life"      
OL,19,Fbuilder when he failed to complete an  
OL,20,Fextension to her home in Anwick,       
OL,21,FLincolnshire.                          
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
